// NimBLE constants, field types, layouts and function signatures the GATT
// fakes reproduce from the pinned ESP-IDF. Layouts with pointers differ on the
// host, so for those only the field order is compared. A signature entry
// compiles only when the declaration has exactly that type.
// fakes: tests/consortium_gatt_fakes
// headers: host/ble_hs.h
// target: components/consortium/gatt_transport.cpp
